menu "S31 factory"
    config WT_FACTORY_ENABLE_SD_RECORDING
        bool "Enable SD card recording"
        default n
        help
            Save camera frames as MJPEG AVI files when J1 is not enumerated.
            SW2 pauses/resumes recording. Continuous recording writes large
            amounts of data and consumes SD card capacity and write endurance.

            When disabled, keep camera capture and SD health checks running
            without creating recording directories or writing video files.
            SW2 only logs button events. UVC, CDC and reading existing recordings
            remain available in USB mode.

    config WT_FACTORY_SEGMENT_SECONDS
        int "Maximum recording segment duration (seconds)"
        depends on WT_FACTORY_ENABLE_SD_RECORDING
        range 1 300
        default 60
        help
            Finalize the AVI and start a new file at this duration or 64 MiB.
            Pausing or switching to USB mode also finalizes the current file.
            A power interruption may leave the current .avi.part incomplete.
endmenu
